WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.792 --> 00:00:16.201
Eddy drove fast.

2
00:00:16.202 --> 00:00:24.402
"Skidding is bad for tires," he thought.

3
00:00:24.403 --> 00:00:37.859
"But it's fun!"

4
00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:41.720
Eddy jumped over the dirt hill.

5
00:00:41.721 --> 00:00:47.433
Then he skidded far.

6
00:00:47.434 --> 00:00:50.763
"Yes!" Eddy cried.

7
00:00:50.764 --> 00:01:01.343
Everyone cheered.

8
00:01:01.344 --> 00:01:03.969
Eddy drove off again.

9
00:01:03.970 --> 00:01:11.534
Zippy followed.

10
00:01:11.535 --> 00:01:14.722
They both skidded.

11
00:01:14.723 --> 00:01:17.283
Suddenly—Pop!

12
00:01:17.284 --> 00:01:20.066
"Oh no!" Eddy cried.

13
00:01:20.067 --> 00:01:24.648
"My tire popped!"

14
00:01:24.649 --> 00:01:28.125
"Ha-ha!" Zippy laughed.

15
00:01:28.126 --> 00:01:31.292
"Your tire—" Pop!

16
00:01:31.293 --> 00:01:41.474
"Ugh! My tire popped too!"

17
00:01:41.475 --> 00:01:47.504
Mr. Grill rushed outside.

18
00:01:47.505 --> 00:01:50.958
"What's going on?" he cried.

19
00:01:50.959 --> 00:01:55.023
"We were skidding," Eddy mumbled.

20
00:01:55.024 --> 00:01:59.384
"Our tires popped," said Zippy.

21
00:01:59.385 --> 00:02:05.700
Mr. Grill frowned.

22
00:02:05.701 --> 00:02:19.233
"Come with me," he said.

23
00:02:19.234 --> 00:02:29.315
Mr. Grill found new tires.

24
00:02:29.316 --> 00:02:33.423
"No more skidding," said the teacher.

25
00:02:33.424 --> 00:02:37.478
"Do you know why?"

26
00:02:37.479 --> 00:02:40.577
"Yes," said everyone.

27
00:02:40.578 --> 00:02:45.782
"It's bad for your tires!"
